{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"blade","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Laravel Blade","description":"Syntax coloring and snippets for Laravel Blade (.blade.php).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"blade","name":"Laravel Blade","extensions":[".blade.php"],"grammar":"grammars/blade.json","blockComment":["{{--","--}}"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Laravel Blade","path":"snippets/blade.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/blade.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"<!--\",\n      \"end\": \"-->\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\{\\\\{\\\\-\\\\-\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\-\\\\-\\\\}\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[A-Za-z]+\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\{\\\\{|\\\\}\\\\}|\\\\{!!|!!\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"</?[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9:-]*\",\n      \"token\": \"tag\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[A-Za-z:@-]+(?==)\",\n      \"token\": \"attribute\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"/?>\",\n      \"token\": \"tag\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/blade.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"If\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"if\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@if (${1:condition})\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"@endif\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"@if\"\n  },\n  \"Foreach\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"foreach\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@foreach (${1:\\\\$items} as ${2:\\\\$item})\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"@endforeach\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"@foreach\"\n  },\n  \"Extends\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ext\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@extends('${1:layouts.app}')\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"@extends\"\n  },\n  \"Section\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@section('${1:content}')\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"@endsection\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"@section\"\n  },\n  \"Echo\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"e\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{{ ${1:\\\\$value} }}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Escaped output\"\n  },\n  \"Include\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"inc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@include('${1:partials.name}')\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"@include\"\n  },\n  \"Form\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"form\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<form method=\\\"POST\\\" action=\\\"{{ route('${1:name}') }}\\\">\",\n      \"\\t@csrf\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"</form>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A form with CSRF\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Laravel Blade\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Laravel Blade.\n\n## Files\n\n`.blade.php`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- 7 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `if` | @if |\n| `foreach` | @foreach |\n| `ext` | @extends |\n| `sec` | @section |\n| `e` | Escaped output |\n| `inc` | @include |\n| `form` | A form with CSRF |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}